\Big|\big| x-2\big|-1\Big|+\Big|\big| x-2\big|-1\Big|=1&&\Rightarrow \begin{cases}x=3&\phantom{aa}\\x=1&\phantom{aa}\end{cases}\text{,}\\
\Big|\big| y-2\big|-1\Big|+\Big|\big| y-2\big|-1\Big|=1&&\Rightarrow \begin{cases}y=3&\phantom{aa}\\y=1&\phantom{aa}\end{cases}\text{,}\\
\Big|\big| -x-2\big|-1\Big|+\Big|\big| y-2\big|-1\Big|=1&&\Rightarrow \begin{cases} x=-1\\y=3\\y=1\\y=3\end{cases}\text{,}\\
\Big|\big| x-2\big|-1\Big|+\Big|\big| y+2\big|-1\Big|=1&&\Rightarrow \begin{cases} x=3&y=-3\\x=1& y=-1\\x=-1& y=-3\\x=3& y=-1\end{cases}\text{.}
\end{align*}
Now we have four rectangles, we add their quotients of rounded corners. $\boxed{8+8\sqrt{2}+8\sqrt{2}+8\sqrt{2}+8+8}=48+24\sqrt{2}.$</answer>

